# Baseline for the *ForTest* liveness census (internal/fortestcensus, #17342):
# hooks in non-test Go code that nothing calls, each with the reason it stays.
# Format: <hook id>\t<defining file>\t<reason>, where the hook id is
# <package dir>.<Name> or <package dir>.(<Receiver>).<Name>. The census fails
# on a row whose hook gained a caller, moved to another file, or is gone, so
# this list cannot outlive its entries.
pkg/linuxsock.(PpollRecv).AttachRecvFnForTest	pkg/linuxsock/ppoll.go	it is the only setter of the recvFn field that PpollRecv.Recv branches on (#17231); deleting it orphans that product-code branch, so it goes with a product change, not a test-seam cleanup
